  "worked_solution": "We distribute the terms of the trinomial in the first set of parentheses to the binomial in the second set of parentheses. Then, we simplify:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(2x-y+2z)(y+2x) & = \\\\ 2x(y+2x)+(-y)(y+2x)+2z(y+2x) & = \\\\ 2xy+4{x}^{2}-{y}^{2}-2xy+2zy+4zx & = \\\\ 4{x}^{2}-{y}^{2}+2zy+4zx\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,  the coefficient of $zx$ is $4.$",
